cd-sensor-dummy.c includes <lcms2.h>, but the module does not depend on
lcms, so it misses lcms2's include path where lcms2.h is not in
/usr/include (OpenIndiana: /usr/include/lcms2).  Solaris worked around
this with #include <lcms/lcms2.h>; add the dependency instead.

Written for OpenIndiana (packages/library/colord); suitable for upstream.

--- a/src/sensors/dummy/meson.build
+++ b/src/sensors/dummy/meson.build
@@ -13,5 +13,6 @@
   c_args : cargs,
   dependencies : [
     gio,
+    lcms,
   ],
 )
